    "title": "Week 13 Start/Sit Fantasy Football Advice - NewsBreak",
    "text": "5 hours ago In most fantasy football leagues, the playoffs begin in Week 15, meaning we are in crunch time, folks! Week 12 was another typical week in the NFL. We had some upsets, some games that were much closer than anticipated, and just a few that went more or less as expected. As for my Week 12 Start/Sit article, I had a much better week, batting 1.000 on the onesie positions, with mixed results at RB and WR, faring better on the “Sit” side of things at those positions. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
